    "content" : "−∆∞,Λu = −∆∞u − |∇u| Λ (x,|∇u|),∇u . Remark 7. We shall show that the equation (7.1) has a unique continuous viscosity solution. Since un is continuous and { ∇un Lm : p−n m} is bounded for all m > d, the uniform convergence limit of every subsequence of un is again continuous. Hence the uniqueness result indicates that the whole sequence un, not just a subsequence, converges uniformly to the unique continuous viscosity solution of (7.1)."
